diagnostics/familiar-type-names.em:12:14: `ValueError` is not a type
  catch error: ValueError {
               ^^^^^^^^^^
Emerald has no `ValueError`. `to_int`, `to_float`, and the other failures Emerald raises itself are a `RuntimeError`, so write `catch error: RuntimeError`, or `catch error` to handle any error.
